{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"6648","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v4978","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"なかざわひのと","creatorId":"vndb:s6823","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:3726","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6823","name":"なかざわひのと","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:13255","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"仁村紳志","creatorId":"vndb:s1608","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2163","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1608","name":"仁村紳志","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:13256","source":"egs"}],"music":[],"other":[{"creditedName":"ウシ子(うし子)","creatorId":"vndb:s2810","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:1442","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2810","name":"ウシ子(うし子)","detail":"企画、原案","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:186570","source":"egs"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c37967","characterName":"住吉 敬子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"193744","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"269991"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26028"],"vndbCharacterId":"c37967"},"originalCharacterName":"住吉 敬子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"過疎化の進んだ山奥の寒村の寺の尼僧。現在は住職代理として寺を守っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"僧衣に包まれながらも、その豊満なバストは破壊力抜群。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとり落ち着いた雰囲気の女性だが、その過去には秘密がありそうだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"全裸で滝に打たれているところを、主人公に襲われ、強姦されてしまうが、そうしたことに対し、全く意に介さず、何事もないように振舞える彼女は……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26028","sourceWorkId":"6648","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"過疎化が進んだ山村の寺の尼僧。住職代理。おっとりとした雰囲気の清廉な尼僧、しかしその実は…？毒島音露の凶悪な本性も暴行も全く意に介さない底知れぬ胆力を隠し持つ謎の女性。音露の猜疑の目も厭わず不可解な行動をとることも…。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"193744"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e4aa6bea41f314231fcf5bf317688b73019450030eaaf8ac892549f8c14db06e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6ca4c05b854a3f5d5fc52be563f11fc5d4c45a2a311d3537c213fedfc0fb75d2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"若泉絵子","creatorId":"vndb:s1099","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1099","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1099","name":"若泉 絵子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:269991:193744:25167:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c37968","characterName":"三宅 玖美子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"193745","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"269991"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26029"],"vndbCharacterId":"c37968"},"originalCharacterName":"三宅 玖美子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"村一帯を取り仕切っていた地主の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来、明るく気さくな女性なのだが、夫と子供を同時に亡くしたショックで、その面影はなく、暗く沈んだままで、無気力の状態になっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため、身の回りの世話は、使用人に任せっきりになっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26029","sourceWorkId":"6648","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"未亡人。村の一帯を取り仕切っていた地主の娘。とある事情で夫と子供を亡くし、供養として村に戻り悲しみに暮れながら四十九日を迎えようとしている。本来は明るく、人好きする性格だった。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"193745"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7b/7b6fa39a93fa9824c980cf68835719c418cbb1027ee43e836e66f6d71b282f3e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-asse